        "original_id": "8a61744c-6cec-5cf3-a726-3e3947e24ce5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bryan Brown, Peter Hehir, Paul McCartney, Ringo Starr, Peter Webb\n- Films: Breaker Morant, Give My Regards to Broad Street, F/X, Cocktail, Gorillas in the Mist, Rikky and Pete, The Girl Who Came Late, Sweet Talker, Return to the Blue Lagoon, F/X2, Along Came Polly, Australia, The Boys, Kill Me Three Times, Gods of Egypt\n\nFacts:\n- Since the late 1970s, Bryan Brown has performed in over eighty film and television projects in Australia and abroad.\n- Bryan Brown appeared in the film Breaker Morant in 1980.\n- Give My Regards to Broad Street is a 1984 British musical drama film directed by Peter Webb and starring Paul McCartney, Bryan Brown, and Ringo Starr.\n- Bryan Brown appeared in the films F/X in 1986, Cocktail in 1988, and Gorillas in the Mist in 1988.\n- Peter Hehir appeared in Rikky and Pete in 1988.\n- Bryan Brown starred in the 1991 Australian film Sweet Talker.\n- Peter Hehir appeared in The Girl Who Came Late, Sweet Talker, and Return to the Blue Lagoon in 1991.\n- Bryan Brown appeared in F/X2 in 1991, Along Came Polly in 2004, Australia in 2008, Kill Me Three Times in 2014, and Gods of Egypt in 2016.\n- Peter Hehir appeared in The Boys in 1998.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
